DataStructures: "1. Graph Data Structures" {
  class: container
  AdjList: "Adjacency List (Sparse O(V+E))"
  AdjMatrix: "Adjacency Matrix (Dense O(V^2))"
}

Traversals: "2. Core Traversals & Cycle Detection" {
  class: container
  BFS: "Breadth-First Search (Frontier Queue)"
  DFS: "DFS 3-Color Cycle Detection\n(White=0, Gray=1, Black=2)"
}

Algorithms: "3. Dependencies & Shortest Paths" {
  class: container
  Kahn: "Kahn's Topological Sort (In-Degree Queue)"
  DSU: "Union-Find DSU (Path Compression)"
  Dijkstra: "Dijkstra Priority Queue (O((V+E)logV))"
}

DataStructures -> Traversals -> Algorithms